summary:
  main.qml does not build the watch.

history:
  The rule and the watch are tested on their own; neither does anything
  until main.qml builds the watch with the widget, the engine and the
  player.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
      StandWatch { id: standWatch; app: root; engine: timeshift; player: playMusic }

replace:
      Item { id: standWatch }

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_stream_that_stands_is_handed_to_the_road_every_other_death_takes.
  Line-neutral.
